00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:17,940
So encouraging to refocus our attention through music on Jesus and remind ourselves that he is the one that truly matters.

3
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:25,800
And so I'm thankful for that and thankful for Pastor Brian last week reminding us in this series, My Part Matters,

4
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:32,320
that My Part Only Matters because Jesus' part matters exceedingly and abundantly more than our part matters,

5
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:37,360
laying the foundation for our obedience mattering to this whole thing.

6
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:44,320
So we've been in a series called My Part Matters where we're really just looking at some intentional actions and attitudes

7
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:51,160
