14
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:19,440
So that's kind of the theme for our series.

15
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:24,620
And not only does your part matter, but so is my part, right?

16
00:01:24,620 --> 00:01:27,220
And Pastor Matt's part and our leadership part.

17
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:31,280
The leadership kind of has a different part in this story.

18
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:36,240
And the part that we really need to be doing at the moment is charting the course,

19
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:40,060
showing you all the direction that we are headed as a church.

20
00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:49,200
