00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:10,620
I just want to tell you that I believe in this leadership principle about leading as fast as it is wise.

53
00:04:10,620 --> 00:04:15,760
I believe that the kingdom of God is important and we should be about doing things.

54
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:18,180
We should be about making a difference in our community.

55
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:22,380
