00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:22,060
Serve the Lord enthusiastically.

154
00:12:22,060 --> 00:12:23,920
Rejoice in our confident hope.

155
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,420
Be patient in trouble.

156
00:12:25,420 --> 00:12:26,660
Keep on praying.

157
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:29,860
