00:13:56,080 --> 00:14:01,960
To form a community that's focused on submitting their lives to the word and leadership of Jesus.

183
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:10,500
And being transformed into a new community that's built on the principles that this community was designed to be built around.

184
00:14:10,500 --> 00:14:22,440
And as we form that community, when we go out into the greater community and demonstrate what it looks like to live in accordance with policies that are.

